  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat large, nonstick sauté pan on medium-high heat for 2 to 3 minutes. Place beef in pan (wash hands); brown for 5 to 7 minutes, stirring to crumble meat, or until no pink remains. Stir in taco seasoning; remove meat from pan.",
